; `show` acceptance: a package root of its own, SYS:PkgShow, with no index
; yet and soliton revision 1 in the cache.
Failat 21
Protect RAM:rxt/apkg +e
Protect RAM:rxt/PkgManager +e
Delete SYS:PkgShow ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:PkgShow
MakeDir SYS:PkgShow/db
MakeDir SYS:PkgShow/cache
Copy RAM:rxt/SOLR1 SYS:PkgShow/cache/soliton.zip
Copy RAM:rxt/RESCODEZIP SYS:PkgShow/cache/rescode.zip
; a root with no index, for ARexx NOINDEX and then TOOLONG
Delete SYS:PkgEmpty ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:PkgEmpty
MakeDir SYS:PkgEmpty/db
